  "frames": [
   "frames/s49_a.jpg",
   "frames/s49_m.jpg",
   "frames/s49_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "after five years of that night cream was the first thing I noticed. Day one, soft all day, not tight by the afternoon for the first time in years."
 },
 {
