  "dur": 6.93,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s51_a.jpg",
   "frames/s51_m.jpg",
   "frames/s51_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "Week two, the hollows under my eyes slowly started filling in. Ah, two weeks."
 },
 {
