  "dur": 0.97,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s57_a.jpg",
   "frames/s57_m.jpg",
   "frames/s57_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "Why?"
 },
 {
  "shot": 58,
  "start": 200.63,
  "end": 209.17,
  "dur": 8.53,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s58_a.jpg",
   "frames/s58_m.jpg",
   "frames/s58_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "Because I'm 57 and I spent five years and I don't know how much money, and a stranger in a queue sorted in two weeks. Why does nobody know about this?"
 },
 {
  "shot": 59,
  "start": 209.17,
  "end": 211.93,
  "dur": 2.77,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s59_a.jpg",
   "frames/s59_m.jpg",
   "frames/s59_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "Because nobody in that shop sells it."
 },
 {
  "shot": 60,
  "start": 211.93,
  "end": 217.07,
  "dur": 5.13,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s60_a.jpg",
   "frames/s60_m.jpg",
   "frames/s60_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "Explain it to me properly because I need to understand what has been going on in my bathroom."
 },
 {
  "shot": 61,
  "start": 217.07,
  "end": 219.07,
  "dur": 2.0,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s61_a.jpg",
   "frames/s61_m.jpg",
   "frames/s61_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "Okay, it's two things."
 },
 {
  "shot": 62,
  "start": 219.07,
  "end": 225.07,
  "dur": 6.0,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s62_a.jpg",
   "frames/s62_m.jpg",
   "frames/s62_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "The first one is what you've lost. Collagen holds your face up. Elastim is what makes your skin snap back."
 },
 {
  "shot": 63,
  "start": 225.07,
  "end": 229.9,
  "dur": 4.83,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s63_a.jpg",
   "frames/s63_m.jpg",
   "frames/s63_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "After 40 you barely make either one, so there's nothing underneath holding anything in place."
 },
 {
  "shot": 64,
  "start": 229.9,
  "end": 232.57,
  "dur": 2.67,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s64_a.jpg",
   "frames/s64_m.jpg",
   "frames/s64_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "That's your lines, that's your hollows, that's your jaw."
 },
 {
  "shot": 65,
  "start": 232.57,
  "end": 235.63,
  "dur": 3.07,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s65_a.jpg",
   "frames/s65_m.jpg",
   "frames/s65_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "It was never your age and it was never dryness."
 },
 {
  "shot": 66,
  "start": 235.63,
  "end": 238.5,
  "dur": 2.87,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s66_a.jpg",
   "frames/s66_m.jpg",
   "frames/s66_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "So I should have been buying a collagen cream."
 },
 {
  "shot": 67,
  "start": 238.5,
  "end": 245.8,
  "dur": 7.3,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s67_a.jpg",
   "frames/s67_m.jpg",
   "frames/s67_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "You'd have wasted more money, that's the second thing. The collagen in those jaws is far too big to get into your skin. Your skin keeps things out, that is its"
 },
 {
  "shot": 68,
  "start": 245.8,
  "end": 251.17,
  "dur": 5.37,
  "frames": [
   "frames/s68_a.jpg",
   "frames/s68_m.jpg",
   "frames/s68_z.jpg"
  ],
  "words": "entire job and it's very good at it. Five years of that. And"
 },
